                                text="&lt;p>In&amp;nbsp;February 2025, as part of our internal pre-disclosure process, AbbVie wrote to each HCP to review and&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;transfers of value ahead of our submission to the ABPI.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa; &lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;In alignment with ABPI guidance, AbbVie has published its 2024 data &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abpi.org.uk/reputation/disclosure-uk/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>here&lt;/a>.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;If you are an HCP and have an enquiry related to the transparency initiative, please send an email to&amp;nbsp;UK.Transparency@abbvie.com&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
